sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant VM as ViewModel
    participant R as Repository
    participant L as Local DB
    participant Q as Sync Queue
    participant N as NetworkMonitor
    participant API as Remote API

    Note over U: Offline Mode

    U->>VM: Create User
    VM->>R: createUser(user)
    R->>L: Save Locally (Optimistic)
    activate L
    L-->>R: Success
    deactivate L

    R->>API: POST /users
    activate API
    API--xR: Network Error
    deactivate API

    R->>Q: Queue PendingChange
    activate Q
    Note over Q: {operation: "create"<br/>user: {...}<br/>retryCount: 0}
    deactivate Q

    R-->>VM: Return User (from local)
    VM-->>U: Show Success (Offline)

    Note over N: Network Restored

    N->>N: Detect Connection
    N->>R: Trigger processOfflineChanges()
    activate R

    R->>Q: Fetch Pending Changes
    activate Q
    Q-->>R: List<PendingChange>
    deactivate Q

    loop For each pending change
        R->>API: Sync Operation
        activate API
        API-->>R: Success/Failure
        deactivate API

        alt Success
            R->>Q: Delete Change
            R->>L: Update with Server Response
        else Failure
            R->>Q: Increment Retry Count
            alt Retry Count >= 3
                R->>Q: Delete Change (Max Retries)
                Note over R: Log Failed Sync
            end
        end
    end

    R-->>N: Sync Complete
    deactivate R

    Note over U: All Changes Synced
